@startuml contribution3_runtime_overlay_config
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
left to right direction

file "configs/default.yaml\n(base **runtime** + bridge)" as DEF
file "**runtime_overrides.yaml**\n(overlay on disk)" as OVL

component "Bridge **startup**\n(`server.py`)" as BOOT
component "**DeepMerge**\n`runtime_cfg` + `runtime_overlay`" as MERGE
map "current_runtime" as CUR {
  policy.dqn => *
  policy.reward => *
  control_mode => *
}
component "**Policy**\n`build_policy_from_config`\n`apply_runtime_config`" as POL

DEF --> BOOT : load config
OVL --> BOOT : `load_runtime_overlay()`\n(if file exists)
BOOT --> MERGE
MERGE --> CUR
CUR --> POL : initial apply

component "**AiBotConfigScreen**\n(Minecraft UI)" as UI
component "**RuntimeOverlayFileWatchLoop**\n(poll mtime)" as WATCH
component "WebSocket handler\n`kind: config_update`" as WSMSG

UI --> OVL : **persistRuntimeOverlayFromUi()**\n(rewards, ε, maps,\n`control_mode`, …)
OVL ..> WATCH : file changed
WATCH --> MERGE : reload overlay\n`refresh_current_runtime()`
WATCH --> POL : `apply_runtime_config`\n(no WS required)

UI ..> WSMSG : **Apply** paths:\n• `ForgeWebSocketClient.sendConfigUpdate`\n  (client has WS)\n• **or** `C2SRuntimeConfigPacket`\n  → `ServerBridgeWebSocketClient.sendConfigUpdate`
WSMSG --> MERGE : merge payload\ninto `runtime_overlay`
WSMSG --> OVL : **`save_runtime_overlay()`**
WSMSG --> POL : **`apply_runtime_config`**

note bottom of OVL
  Path resolution: JVM props, env vars,
  `ai_agent_bridge_data_path.txt`,
  repo `shared/Data`, etc.
end note

note bottom of WATCH
  Interval from
  `runtime_overlay_poll_interval_s`
  (default YAML / env override).
end note

@enduml
